# Audit export

The export endpoint filters by project and a half-open time range: from is
included and to is excluded. Results are ordered by occurred_at and then id,
both ascending. A continuation cursor is exclusive; send the returned opaque
cursor with the same project and time filters to continue.

The default page size is 100. Requests above 500 rows are capped at 500, and a
limit below 1 or a range with from at or after to is rejected. The response has
items and next_cursor; next_cursor is null on the final page. There is no total
count field.

Events are retained for 30 days based on recorded_at, the time the service
stored the event. Events older than 30 days may be removed.
